activity Data Gather
activity Data Analyze
activity Report Draft
activity Report Review
activity Report Revise
activity Report Approve
activity Report Publish
activity Feedback Collect
activity Action Plan Create
activity Actions Implement
bind Data Gather: ID Data, Type Data
bind Data Analyze: ID Data, Score Impact
bind Report Review: ID Reviewer
bind Report Approve: ID Approval
bind Feedback Collect: Type Feedback
bind Report Revise: Type Revision
ID Data: integer between 1 and 10000
Type Data: Environmental, Social, Governance
ID Reviewer: integer between 1 and 5000
ID Approval: integer between 1 and 5000
Score Impact: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Type Feedback: Positive, Negative, Neutral
Type Revision: Minor, Major
Init[Data Gather] | |
End[Report Publish] | |
Precedence[Data Analyze, Data Gather] | | |
Chain Response[Data Analyze, Report Draft] | | |
Precedence[Report Review, Report Draft] | | |
Chain Succession[Report Review, Report Revise] | | |
Response[Report Revise, Report Approve] | | |0,48,h
Chain Response[Report Approve, Report Publish] | | |0,24,h
Chain Succession[Feedback Collect, Action Plan Create] | | |0,7,d
Chain Succession[Action Plan Create, Actions Implement] | | |0,30,d